    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> STARTER: Getting Started with the Digital Tool Store </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4396",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>The STARTER package from the proven TMS Tool Management Solutions offers you the most important functions so you can quickly use the benefits of digital tool management. Thanks to the modular design of TMS Tool Management Solutions, you can expand your tool management at any time with the Bronze, Silver, and Gold packages. </p><ul><li>Access to all tool data</li><li>Call up the storage locations of tools and components</li><li>Manage setup sheets </li></ul><p>Start now to boost efficiency in your tool warehouse.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c4395",
