  },
  {
   "type": "tiles",
   "header": "<h3> STARTER Package Software Modules </h3>",
   "cols": 4,
   "tiles": [
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/f/csm_lagerplaetze_2a89227d89.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Warehouse Location Management Complete tools, tool components, and accessories—always at a glance",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Storage Location Management</h4> <p>With the Storage Location Management module, you always have a clear overview of your complete tools, tool components, and accessories. Storage Location Management contains a virtual 3D assembly that allows you to quickly and simply map your warehouse in three dimensions and assign items to a virtual storage location. Each item created can be managed in terms of stock, giving you a quick overview of the storage location, circulation, and current stock levels. External warehouse and lift systems can, of course, be integrated via interfaces.</p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Quick inventory overview</li><li>Time savings by eliminating the need to search and making walking distances short</li><li>24-hour tool availability</li><li>Reduced tool costs</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_einzelkomponenten_156d7d1aa0.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Management of Individual Components Modules for Configuring Your Individual Components",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Individual Component Management</h4> <p>The software module for the detailed system configuration of individual components creates a future-proof IoT foundation for tool management.</p> <p><strong>System Detail Data Creation:</strong></p><ul><li>DIN 4000/4003/ISO 13399 Parameterization</li><li>Technology Data (Cross-Section Values)</li><li>Graphic Component Representation</li><li>2D and 3D generation in accordance with DIN 4000 and ISO 13399</li><li>Import of 2D formats DXF/DWG/BMP/TIF/JPG/GIF/PNG</li><li>Import of 3D formats: STEP/STL</li><li>Detailed data (e.g., cutting material)</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/c/csm_Verwaltung_von_Einrichteblaettern_5c9fce0b99.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Management of Setup Sheets Simple Management and Forwarding of Setup Sheets",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Management of Setup Sheets</h4> <p>Setup sheets provide the user with a list of information and resources required for an order. These can be forwarded directly to the store, the CAD/CAM workstation, or the machine and used there.</p>"
    }
   ],
